				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-shortcode"><pre class="ti-widget" style="display: none"><template id="trustindex-google-widget-html"><div class=" ti-widget  ti-goog ti-disable-font ti-review-text-mode-readmore ti-text-align-left" data-no-translation="true" data-layout-id="4" data-layout-category="slider" data-set-id="light-minimal" data-pid="" data-language="nl" data-close-locale="Dichtbij" data-review-target-width="300" data-css-version="2" data-review-text-mode="readmore" data-reply-by-locale="Antwoord van eigenaar" data-pager-autoplay-timeout="6"> <div class="ti-widget-container ti-col-3"> <div class="ti-reviews-container"> <div class="ti-controls"> <div class="ti-next" aria-label="Volgende recensie" role="button"></div> <div class="ti-prev" aria-label="Vorige recensie" role="button"></div> </div> <div class="ti-reviews-container-wrapper">  <div data-empty="0" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Geplaatst op </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0_ymjvqwyjEkyuLianWLXOln9KTjLRwsjZCt0kTUN7ewXLaIAyw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100" data-imgurlset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0_ymjvqwyjEkyuLianWLXOln9KTjLRwsjZCt0kTUN7ewXLaIAyw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba6-br100 2x" alt="Babette Verhoef profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Babette Verhoef </div> <div class="ti-date">25/03/2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifieert dat de oorspronkelijke bron van de recensie Google is.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Ik heb deelgenomen aan een via FIT body &amp; mind,  goed verzorgde yoga/skireis naar Oostenrijk, waar we in een comfortabel hotel, met een fijne groep mensen, onder leiding van twee zeer flexibele en aandachtige docenten een intensief ontspannende week hebben gehad.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Verbergen" data-open-text="Lees verder"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Geplaatst op </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKthUjcUg4iM2JzAI3amfZYvznMXOeFuGuDggjcbo_oyUhCbQ=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" data-imgurlset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKthUjcUg4iM2JzAI3amfZYvznMXOeFuGuDggjcbo_oyUhCbQ=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Adriana Boon profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Adriana Boon </div> <div class="ti-date">18/03/2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifieert dat de oorspronkelijke bron van de recensie Google is.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Goed gebalanceerd programma, prima docenten en mooie, aansprekende locaties.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Verbergen" data-open-text="Lees verder"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Geplaatst op </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKV9bUCmdLVfSJjq-7-O7S5NTp-FmNTIksv9ctSK46tQI2iyw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" data-imgurlset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKV9bUCmdLVfSJjq-7-O7S5NTp-FmNTIksv9ctSK46tQI2iyw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Katinka Dijker profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Katinka Dijker </div> <div class="ti-date">18/03/2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifieert dat de oorspronkelijke bron van de recensie Google is.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Yoga, skiën, sauna, massage en een groep fijne mensen op een mooie plek met veel mogelijkheden, het was een week van genieten, flow, relaxen en onthaasten.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Verbergen" data-open-text="Lees verder"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Geplaatst op </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEl5mLEAwhsydBORlZQ8ZVcEjRz59MWcgaBqNUiRz1sR7H-iY=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" data-imgurlset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEl5mLEAwhsydBORlZQ8ZVcEjRz59MWcgaBqNUiRz1sR7H-iY=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Sophie Dek profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Sophie Dek </div> <div class="ti-date">18/03/2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifieert dat de oorspronkelijke bron van de recensie Google is.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Zo’n super gezellige en sportieve skiweek gehad. Skiën Wandelen Yoga in de bergen is een top combi. Goed georganiseerd en fijn begeleid door de mensen van Fit Body &amp; Mind. Aanrader!<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Verbergen" data-open-text="Lees verder"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Geplaatst op </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX3D3yKwqjYvAc9yxdPebwan6A4EuQF7R-a8rNjvvA3vNvdlpoXng=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100" data-imgurlset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX3D3yKwqjYvAc9yxdPebwan6A4EuQF7R-a8rNjvvA3vNvdlpoXng=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100 2x" alt="Estelle Dabekaussen profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Estelle Dabekaussen </div> <div class="ti-date">17/02/2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifieert dat de oorspronkelijke bron van de recensie Google is.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Voor het eerst een retraite geboekt op deze fantastische plek. Heerlijk om even in een liefdevolle bubbel zoveel moois te ervaren…. dank voor de goede zorgen en de onvergetelijke ervaring!<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Verbergen" data-open-text="Lees verder"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Geplaatst op </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJwm4k_iF7M-aUHYu1d5tiqYUDuowFNEVs8Qukbie-HaEB2Mw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" data-imgurlset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJwm4k_iF7M-aUHYu1d5tiqYUDuowFNEVs8Qukbie-HaEB2Mw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Gerald Swart profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Gerald Swart </div> <div class="ti-date">10/02/2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifieert dat de oorspronkelijke bron van de recensie Google is.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Geweldige organisatie met super retraites! Heerlijke mini vakantie met naast mooie innerlijke reizen ook verrassend lekker eten, prachtige welness met heerlijk zonverwarmd zwembad en ruime sauna, goede masseuses en een plek die uitnodigt om tot rust te komen.
Kortom een aanrader om een paar keer per jaar te bezoeken!<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Verbergen" data-open-text="Lees verder"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Geplaatst op </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocItFxYm0XdMsBIAoJy_YAq75cxnNW80KWU7po62TIaN0Zh8Mw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" data-imgurlset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocItFxYm0XdMsBIAoJy_YAq75cxnNW80KWU7po62TIaN0Zh8Mw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="gz psycholoog profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> gz psycholoog </div> <div class="ti-date">11/01/2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifieert dat de oorspronkelijke bron van de recensie Google is.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Wat een fijne verstillende yoga (Nidra/Yin) retraite had ik bij Fitbody&amp;mind in de eerste dagen van het nieuwe jaar. De ICE special met Esther was het ultieme Loslaten.
Niet te vergeten: het heerlijke (vega) eten verzorgd door Puur Koken van Karin Baank was zaaalig.
Ik kom zeker weer eens terug.
Wellicht dat het programma ook wat actievere yoga retraites gaat bevatten, ook dat lijkt me fijn.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Verbergen" data-open-text="Lees verder"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da"> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Geplaatst op </span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKNWnRfyTXghgs8lXgl-uqwn_NbsCCqbHS-P6hIDGydsFlwpA=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100" data-imgurlset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKNWnRfyTXghgs8lXgl-uqwn_NbsCCqbHS-P6hIDGydsFlwpA=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100 2x" alt="xandervdb profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> xandervdb </div> <div class="ti-date">07/01/2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="h